    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamScrollBox.h#DreamScrollBox:AddContent
    src   "Put a widget in the content stack and re-measure."
    text  "将一个控件放入内容堆栈并重新测量。"
    state machine
}

DreamScrollBox:AnalogMouseWheelKey {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamScrollBox.h#DreamScrollBox:AnalogMouseWheelKey
    src   "The analog key that acts as this box's mouse wheel -- UMG's AnalogMouseWheelKey. Invalid (the\ndefault) means \"whatever the input preset already routes here\", which is the right stick and\ntherefore exactly what every existing box does."
    text  "充当此滚动框鼠标滚轮的模拟键——即UMG的AnalogMouseWheelKey。Invalid\n（默认值）表示“沿用输入预设已经路由到此的输入”，也就是右摇杆，\n因而正是所有现有滚动框的行为。"
    state machine
}

DreamScrollBox:bAllowOverscroll {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamScrollBox.h#DreamScrollBox:bAllowOverscroll
    src   "Let the content be pulled past an end and spring back -- UMG's AllowOverscroll."
    text  "允许内容被拉过端点后再弹回——即 UMG 的 AllowOverscroll。"
    state machine
}

DreamScrollBox:bAllowRightClickDragScrolling {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamScrollBox.h#DreamScrollBox:bAllowRightClickDragScrolling
    src   "Whether a drag with the RIGHT button scrolls it -- UMG's bAllowRightClickDragScrolling. The drag\nscrolls from the press, the move that crossed the drag threshold included, as SScrollBox's does,\nso the content stays under the pointer that grabbed it. Over the content only: a right drag that\nstarts on the box's own bar is the bar's, and the bar answers the left button alone (see\nUDreamScrollBar::AcceptedMouseButtons), so it scrolls nothing."
    text  "是否可用右键拖动来滚动——即 UMG 的 bAllowRightClickDragScrolling。拖动\n从按下时起就滚动，包括越过拖动阈值的那次移动，与 SScrollBox 的行为相同，\n因此内容始终停留在抓住它的指针下方。仅限内容区域：从框自身的滚动条上\n开始的右键拖动属于滚动条，而滚动条只响应左键（参见\nUDreamScrollBar::AcceptedMouseButtons），所以它不会滚动任何内容。"
    state machine
}

DreamScrollBox:bAlwaysShowScrollbarTrack {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamScrollBox.h#DreamScrollBox:bAlwaysShowScrollbarTrack
    src   "Whether the bar's TRACK is drawn while the bar is idle -- UMG's AlwaysShowScrollbarTrack, which raises\nan idle track from invisible to half its alpha (SScrollBar::GetTrackOpacity). Hovering or dragging the\nbar draws the track at full alpha whatever this says, and Permanent draws an idle one at half.\n\nThat is all it does, as in UMG: it keeps neither the bar nor its gutter while nothing scrolls. Only\nScrollBarVisibility set to Permanent keeps the bar out then."
    text  "滚动条空闲时是否绘制其轨道——即UMG的AlwaysShowScrollbarTrack，该设置把\n空闲轨道从不可见提升到一半的不透明度（SScrollBar::GetTrackOpacity）。无论此项如何，悬停或拖动\n滚动条时轨道都以完整不透明度绘制，而Permanent时空闲轨道绘制为一半。\n\n与UMG一样，它仅此而已：没有任何滚动时，它既不保留滚动条，也不保留其留白。只有\n滚动条可视性（ScrollBarVisibility）设为Permanent时，才会让滚动条继续显示。"
    state machine
}

DreamScrollBox:bAnimateWheelScrolling {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamScrollBox.h#DreamScrollBox:bAnimateWheelScrolling
    src   "A wheel notch GLIDES instead of teleporting -- UMG's AnimateWheelScrolling. Off by default,\nwhich is what every existing box already does."
    text  "滚轮的一格是滑行而不是瞬移——即 UMG 的 AnimateWheelScrolling。默认关闭，\n这也是现有每个框本来就有的行为。"
    state machine
}

DreamScrollBox:bBackPadScrolling {
