    src   "A whole window of empty space BEFORE the content, so the first item can be scrolled all the way\nto the trailing edge -- UMG's BackPadScrolling. A window, not half of one, which is Slate's\narithmetic."
    text  "在内容之前留出整整一屏的空白，好让第一个项目能一直滚动\n到后缘——即 UMG 的 BackPadScrolling。是一整屏而非半屏，这是 Slate 的\n计算方式。"
    state machine
}

