DreamScrollBox:GetAnimateWheelScrolling {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamScrollBox.h#DreamScrollBox:GetAnimateWheelScrolling
    src   "The four scroll commands UMG's box offers, forwarded to the behaviour.\n\nForwarded rather than left to GetScrollView(): the behaviour has had all of them since it was\nwritten, and a consumer reaching through the accessor to call them is a consumer reaching past\nthe control into a part the control owns -- which is the one thing this whole family exists to\nmake unnecessary. GetScrollView() stays for everything genuinely beyond the control's surface."
    text  "UMG 的框提供的四个滚动命令，转发给该行为。\n\n选择转发而不是留给 GetScrollView()：该行为自编写之初就已具备全部这些命令，\n而使用者通过访问器去调用它们，就等于越过控件伸进控件自己拥有的部分——\n而这正是这一整个系列存在的意义，即让这种做法变得不必要。GetScrollView()\n仍然保留，用于确实超出控件表面的一切。"
    state machine
}

