DreamScrollBox:IsAlwaysShowScrollbar {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamScrollBox.h#DreamScrollBox:IsAlwaysShowScrollbar
    src   "Whether the bar stays put with nothing to scroll -- UMG's AlwaysShowScrollbar.\n\nA reader of ScrollBarVisibility rather than a flag beside it: Permanent IS \"always show\", and\ntwo properties that both answered would be two answers to keep in step."
    text  "无内容可滚动时滚动条是否保持显示——即UMG的AlwaysShowScrollbar。\n\n它是对滚动条可视性（ScrollBarVisibility）的读取，而不是在其旁边另设的标志：Permanent本身就是“始终显示”，而\n两个都能回答同一问题的属性，就是两份需要保持同步的答案。"
    state machine
}

