DreamScrollBox:OnFocusUpdated {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamScrollBox.h#DreamScrollBox:OnFocusUpdated
    src   "Focus moved to something INSIDE the box -- UMG's OnFocusUpdated.\n\nNot gated on bIsFocusable, and that is the point: this is about the box's CONTENT, which is\nfocusable whether or not the box is. Raised from the navigation reveal, the one place that\nknows both which widget took focus and which scrolling ancestors contain it -- a box cannot\nwork that out alone, and polling HasFocusedDescendants would be a tick for an edge."
    text  "焦点移到了滚动框内部的某个对象——即UMG的OnFocusUpdated。\n\n不受bIsFocusable约束，而这正是关键：这里说的是滚动框的内容，无论框本身是否\n可聚焦，内容都是可聚焦的。由导航显现触发，那是唯一同时\n知道哪个控件获得了焦点、哪些滚动祖先包含它的地方——滚动框自身\n无法判断这一点，而轮询HasFocusedDescendants会为一个边沿事件而每帧执行。"
    state machine
}

DreamScrollBox:OnScrollBarVisibilityChanged {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamScrollBox.h#DreamScrollBox:OnScrollBarVisibilityChanged
    src   "The bar appeared or went away -- UMG's OnScrollBarVisibilityChanged. Fired from the style push,\nwhich is the one place that decides, and only when the answer actually moved."
    text  "滚动条出现或消失（滚动条可视性发生变化）——即UMG的OnScrollBarVisibilityChanged。由样式推送\n触发，那是唯一做出决定的地方，且仅在结果确实发生变化时触发。"
    state machine
}

DreamScrollBox:OnScrolled {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamScrollBox.h#DreamScrollBox:OnScrolled
    src   "Re-broadcast from the scroll behaviour, so a consumer binds to the control, not to a part of it."
    text  "从滚动行为重新广播，因此使用方绑定的是控件本身，而不是它的某个部件。"
    state machine
}

DreamScrollBox:OnUserScrolled {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamScrollBox.h#DreamScrollBox:OnUserScrolled
    src   "The USER moved it -- UMG's OnUserScrolled, and its unit, which is an OFFSET rather than a\nprogress.\n\nSeparate from OnScrolled because the question is different: OnScrolled fires for every change,\nincluding the ones this control made itself (a style push re-states the progress; a setter\nwrites it). A consumer saving \"where the player left the list\" wants the ones the player made,\nand nothing else could tell them apart afterwards."
    text  "用户移动了它——即UMG的OnUserScrolled，以及它的单位，即偏移量而不是\n进度。\n\n与OnScrolled分开是因为问题不同：OnScrolled对每一次变化都会触发，\n包括此控件自身造成的变化（样式推送会重述进度；setter会\n写入进度）。保存“玩家把列表留在哪里”的使用方想要的是玩家造成的变化，\n而事后没有别的办法能把两者区分开。"
    state machine
}

DreamScrollBox:OnValueChangedBP {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamScrollBox.h#DreamScrollBox:OnValueChangedBP
    src   "The `<->` convention: a two-way binding synthesizes its reverse route against this exact name.\nA scroll box's value is where it is scrolled to, so it carries one and fires it with OnScrolled."
    text  "`<->`约定：双向绑定会针对这个确切的名称合成其反向路由。\n滚动框的值就是它滚动到的位置，因此它携带该值并用OnScrolled触发。"
    state machine
}

DreamScrollBox:Orientation {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamScrollBox.h#DreamScrollBox:Orientation
    src   "Which way it scrolls, and which way its content stacks. One property instead of two Blueprint\nassets.\n\nBlueprintSetter, like the four knobs below it: every one of these is read only by ApplyStyle,\nso a runtime write straight onto the variable used to change the number and nothing else --\nnothing in this family re-derives a control from a property that moved, which is the\nSynchronizeProperties tax UDreamUIControl documents. Through the setter the re-push is not\nsomething a caller has to know to make."
    text  "它沿哪个方向滚动，以及它的内容沿哪个方向堆叠。用一个属性而非两个蓝图\n资产。\n\n与下面四个开关一样是BlueprintSetter：这里的每一项都只由ApplyStyle读取，\n因此直接对变量做运行时写入只会改变数值而别无其他——\n这一族里没有任何东西会因属性变动而重新派生控件，那正是\nUDreamUIControl所记录的SynchronizeProperties代价。经由setter，重新推送就不再是\n调用方必须知道要做的事。"
    state machine
}

DreamScrollBox:RefreshContentExtent {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamScrollBox.h#DreamScrollBox:RefreshContentExtent
    src   "Re-take the content's extent from the stack and tell the behaviour its range moved -- and, when\nthat changed whether anything overflows, bring an auto-hiding bar out or put it away.\n\nThe counterpart of UUIScrollView::RectRangeChanged, and it exists for the same reason: nothing\nre-measures a scrolled column on its own, because the column's size is not layout output -- it\nis the control's statement of how far there is to scroll."
    text  "从堆叠中重新获取内容的范围，并告知行为其范围已移动——并且，当\n这改变了是否有内容溢出时，让自动隐藏的滚动条出现或收起。\n\n对应 UUIScrollView::RectRangeChanged，它存在的理由也相同：没有任何东西\n会自行重新测量被滚动的列，因为列的大小不是布局输出——它是\n控件对可滚动距离的声明。"
    state machine
}

DreamScrollBox:ScrollBarVisibility {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamScrollBox.h#DreamScrollBox:ScrollBarVisibility
    src   "Whether the bar stays put or disappears while the content already fits. AutoHide follows the\ncontent at run time: every re-measure (AddContent, RefreshContentExtent, a resize) asks again, so\na box that starts or stops overflowing brings its bar out or puts it away, as UMG's does -- the bar and\nits gutter both collapse while nothing scrolls. Hidden never draws the bar but keeps its gutter while\nthere is something to scroll, as a Hidden Slate bar keeps its slot; Permanent is UMG's AlwaysShowScrollbar."
    text  "当内容已经放得下时，滚动条是保持不动还是消失。AutoHide 在运行时跟随\n内容：每次重新测量（AddContent、RefreshContentExtent、调整大小）都会再次询问，因此\n开始或停止溢出的框会像 UMG 那样让滚动条出现或收起——在无可滚动内容时，滚动条及其\n槽位都会折叠。Hidden 从不绘制滚动条，但在有内容可滚动时保留其槽位，就像 Hidden 的\nSlate 滚动条保留其槽位一样；Permanent 即 UMG 的 AlwaysShowScrollbar。"
    state machine
}

DreamScrollBox:ScrollProgress {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamScrollBox.h#DreamScrollBox:ScrollProgress
    src   "Position along the scrolling axis, 0 to 1. Authored in; mirror of the behaviour's out, so a\n`.dui` binding and the designer can both see it.\n\nThe authored value is pushed until it lands on content that can scroll -- a box built empty\nand filled later still opens where it was authored to -- and again whenever it is set or edited.\nEvery other style push reads the view's progress back into it instead, so restyling a box never\nmoves its content."
    text  "沿滚动轴的位置，0 到 1。在编辑时设定；镜像行为的输出，因此\n`.dui` 绑定和设计器都能看到它。\n\n设定的值会被推送，直到落到可滚动的内容上——一个先建空、之后再填充的\n框仍会打开在设定值所指的位置——并在每次被设置或编辑时再次推送。\n其他每次样式推送则会把视图的进度读回其中，因此重新设置样式永远不会\n移动内容。"
    state machine
}

DreamScrollBox:ScrollSensitivity {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamScrollBox.h#DreamScrollBox:ScrollSensitivity
    src   "Local units travelled per mouse-wheel notch. It used to be documented as a MULTIPLIER and\npushed straight into a view that multiplied the raw axis by it, so the default of 1 moved the\ncontent one unit a notch -- a wheel that visibly did nothing. 40 is what\nUDreamLayoutContainerScrollBox already uses for the same gesture."
    text  "每个鼠标滚轮格移动的本地单位数。它过去被记录为乘数，并被直接\n推入按它乘以原始轴值的视图，因此默认值 1 每格只把内容\n移动一个单位——滚轮看上去毫无效果。UDreamLayoutContainerScrollBox\n对同一手势已经使用 40。"
    state machine
}

DreamScrollBox:ScrollWhenFocusChanges {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamScrollBox.h#DreamScrollBox:ScrollWhenFocusChanges
    src   "What this box does when user focus lands inside it -- UMG's ScrollWhenFocusChanges.\n\nAnimatedScroll rather than UMG's NoScroll, because it is what every box here already does:\ndirectional navigation reveals its target unconditionally, and shipping NoScroll would stop\nevery gamepad-driven list in every existing project from following its focus."
    text  "用户焦点落入此框内时的行为——即 UMG 的 ScrollWhenFocusChanges。\n\n采用 AnimatedScroll 而非 UMG 的 NoScroll，因为这里每个框本来就是这样：\n方向导航会无条件显示其目标，而若采用 NoScroll，所有现有项目中每个由手柄驱动的列表\n都将无法跟随其焦点。"
    state machine
}

DreamScrollBox:ScrollWidgetIntoView {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamScrollBox.h#DreamScrollBox:ScrollWidgetIntoView
    src   "Scroll the least distance that brings InWidget fully into view; nothing when it already is.\n\n@param InDestination Where it ends up. Configured (the default) leaves it to NavigationDestination,\n                     which is what this call meant before the parameter existed.\n@param InPadding     How much of the window to keep clear around it. Negative leaves it to\n                     NavigationScrollPadding, for the same reason."
    text  "以最小距离滚动，使 InWidget（控件）完全进入视野；若已在视野内则不滚动。\n\n@param InDestination 其最终位置。Configured（默认值）将其交由 NavigationDestination 决定，\n                     这也是该参数出现之前此调用的含义。\n@param InPadding（填充） 在其周围保留多少窗口空白。负值出于同样的原因交由\n                     NavigationScrollPadding 决定。"
    state machine
}

DreamScrollBox:SetBackPadScrolling {
