DreamScrollBox:Style {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamScrollBox.h#DreamScrollBox:Style
    src   "This instance's own look. The project sheet wins while StyleSource says so AND a sheet actually\nexists; with no sheet in the project this IS the look in effect -- which is why it stays\neditable instead of being gated on the enum."
    text  "此实例自身的外观。当 StyleSource 指明使用项目样式表且项目中确实存在\n样式表时，以项目样式表为准；若项目中没有样式表，则这里就是实际生效的外观——这正是它保持\n可编辑，而不受枚举值限制的原因。"
    state machine
}

DreamScrollBox:WheelScrollAnimationDuration {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamScrollBox.h#DreamScrollBox:WheelScrollAnimationDuration
    src   "How long one animated notch takes. Ignored while bAnimateWheelScrolling is off."
    text  "一格动画滚动所需的时间。bAnimateWheelScrolling 关闭时忽略。"
