DreamScrollBox:WheelScrollMultiplier {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamScrollBox.h#DreamScrollBox:WheelScrollMultiplier
    src   "A plain multiplier on whatever one wheel notch already travels -- UMG's name, and the list\ncontrols' too, so the three agree.\n\nScrollSensitivity above is the DISTANCE a notch covers, in local units. This scales it, which is\nwhy both exist: a project that wants \"the same feel, twice as fast\" writes 2 here rather than\nre-tuning a distance that then disagrees with every other box in the game."
    text  "对滚轮一格原本移动距离的纯倍率——沿用 UMG 的名称，列表\n控件也是如此，三者因此保持一致。\n\n上方的 ScrollSensitivity 是一格覆盖的距离，以本地单位计。此项对其缩放，这\n也是两者并存的原因：想要“相同手感、两倍速度”的项目在此填 2，而不必\n重新调整距离，否则该距离就会与游戏中其他所有框不一致。"
    state machine
}

